 Æque.","kind":"commentary","noteId":"tertullian-against-marcion-v-iv-2197"},{"text":"[^tertullian-against-marcion-v-iv-2198]: Tamen.","kind":"commentary","noteId":"tertullian-against-marcion-v-iv-2198"},{"text":"[^tertullian-against-marcion-v-iv-2199]: Ex. xx. 12 and Deut. vi. 2 .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"tertullian-against-marcion-v-iv-2199"},{"text":"[^tertullian-against-marcion-v-iv-2200]: Luke x. 27 .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"tertullian-against-marcion-v-iv-2200"},{"text":"[^tertullian-against-marcion-v-iv-2201]: Legalem.","kind":"commentary","noteId":"tertullian-against-marcion-v-iv-2201"},{"text":"[^tertullian-against-marcion-v-iv-2202]: Recidivæ.","kind":"commentary","noteId":"tertullian-against-marcion-v-iv-2202"},{"text":"[^tertullian-against-marcion-v-iv-2203]: This is perhaps the meaning of “ne plus aliquid observationis exigeret sublimior spe.”","kind":"commentary","noteId":"tertullian-against-marcion-v-iv-2203"},{"text":"[^tertullian-against-marcion-v-iv-2204]: Nec alius.","kind":"commentary","noteId":"tertullian-against-marcion-v-iv-2204"},{"text":"[^tertullian-against-marcion-v-iv-2205]: Principaliter.","kind":"commentary","noteId":"tertullian-against-marcion-v-iv-2205"},{"text":"[^tertullian-against-marcion-v-iv-2206]: Et utramque vitam.","kind":"commentary","noteId":"tertullian-against-marcion-v-iv-2206"},{"text":"[^tertullian-against-marcion-v-iv-2207]: Ei opponit.","kind":"commentary","noteId":"tertullian-against-marcion-v-iv-2207"},{"text":"[^tertullian-against-marcion-v-iv-2208]: Caput.","kind":"commentary","noteId":"tertullian-against-marcion-v-iv-2208"},{"text":"[^tertullian-against-marcion-v-iv-2209]: Dei tui…Marcionites.","kind":"commentary","noteId":"tertullian-against-marcion-v-iv-2209"},{"text":"[^tertullian-against-marcion-v-iv-2210]: Captanda.","kind":"commentary","noteId":"tertullian-against-marcion-v-iv-2210"},{"text":"[^tertullian-against-marcion-v-iv-2211]: Præstet.","kind":"commentary","noteId":"tertullian-against-marcion-v-iv-2211"},{"text":"[^tertullian-against-marcion-v-iv-2212]: i.e., he must needs have it taught and recommended by Christ.","kind":"commentary","noteId":"tertullian-against-marcion-v-iv-2212"},{"text":"[^tertullian-against-marcion-v-iv-2213]: Viderit.","kind":"commentary","noteId":"tertullian-against-marcion-v-iv-2213"},{"text":"[^tertullian-against-marcion-v-iv-2214]: As Marcion pretended.","kind":"commentary","noteId":"tertullian-against-marcion-v-iv-2214"},{"text":"[^tertullian-against-marcion-v-iv-2215]: Luke xi. 1 .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"tertullian-against-marcion-v-iv-2215"},{"text":"[^tertullian-against-marcion-v-iv-2216]: Suffigi.","kind":"commentary","noteId":"tertullian-against-marcion-v-iv-2216"},{"text":"[^tertullian-against-marcion-v-iv-2217]: Scito.","kind":"commentary","noteId":"tertullian-against-marcion-v-iv-2217"},{"text":"[^tertullian-against-marcion-v-iv-2218]: Proinde.","kind":"commentary","noteId":"tertullian-against-marcion-v-iv-2218"},{"text":"[^tertullian-against-marcion-v-iv-2219]: Sensum.","kind":"commentary","noteId":"tertullian-against-marcion-v-iv-2219"},{"text":"[^tertullian-against-marcion-v-iv-2220]: Luke xi. 2 .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"tertullian-against-marcion-v-iv-2220"},{"text":"[^tertullian-against-marcion-v-iv-2221]: Generavit.","kind":"commentary","noteId":"tertullian-against-marcion-v-iv-2221"},{"text":"[^tertullian-against-marcion-v-iv-2222]: Mundialis spiritus: perhaps “the breath of life.”","kind":"commentary","noteId":"tertullian-against-marcion-v-iv-2222"},{"text":"[^tertullian-against-marcion-v-iv-2223]: Gen. i. 2 .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"tertullian-against-marcion-v-iv-2223"},{"text":"[^tertullian-against-marcion-v-iv-2224]: Luke xi. 3 .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"tertullian-against-marcion-v-iv-2224"},{"text":"[^tertullian-against-marcion-v-iv-2225]: Milium.","kind":"commentary","noteId":"tertullian-against-marcion-v-iv-2225"},{"text":"[^tertullian-against-marcion-v-iv-2226]: Ps. lxviii. 25 .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"tertullian-against-marcion-v-iv-2226"},{"text":"[^tertullian-against-marcion-v-iv-2227]: Luke xi. 4 .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"tertullian-against-marcion-v-iv-2227"},{"text":"[^tertullian-against-marcion-v-iv-2228]: Prædamnavit.","kind":"commentary","noteId":"tertullian-against-marcion-v-iv-2228"},{"text":"[^tertullian-against-marcion-v-iv-2229]: Hoc ordine.","kind":"commentary","noteId":"tertullian-against-marcion-v-iv-2229"},{"text":"[^tertullian-against-marcion-v-iv-2230]: Infamat.","kind":"commentary","noteId":"tertullian-against-marcion-v-iv-2230"},{"text":"[^tertullian-against-marcion-v-iv-2231]: Luke xi. 9 .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"tertullian-against-marcion-v-iv-2231"},{"text":"[^tertullian-against-marcion-v-iv-2232]: Salutem: perhaps salvation.","kind":"commentary","noteId":"tertullian-against-marcion-v-iv-2232"},{"text":"[^tertullian-against-marcion-v-iv-2233]: Unde sum functus. This obscure clause may mean “the right of praying,” or “the right of access, and boldness to knock.”","kind":"commentary","noteId":"tertullian-against-marcion-v-iv-2233"},{"text":"[^tertullian-against-marcion-v-iv-2234]: Ad præstandum non suo homini.","kind":"commentary","noteId":"tertullian-against-marcion-v-iv-2234"},{"text":"[^tertullian-against-marcion-v-iv-2235]: Autem.","kind":"commentary","noteId":"tertullian-against-marcion-v-iv-2235"},{"text":"[^tertullian-against-marcion-v-iv-2236]: See Luke xi. 5–8 .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"tertullian-against-marcion-v-iv-2236"},{"text":"[^tertullian-against-marcion-v-iv-2237]: A sarcastic allusion to the ante-nuptial error of Marcion, which he has exposed more than once (see book i. chap. xxix. and book iv. chap. xxiii. p. 386.).","kind":"commentary","noteId":"tertullian-against-marcion-v-iv-2237"},{"text":"[^tertullian-against-marcion-v-iv-2238]: Sæculum.","kind":"commentary","noteId":"tertullian-against-marcion-v-iv-2238"},{"text":"[^tertullian-against-marcion-v-iv-2239]: Tantum quod = vixdum (Oehler).","kind":"commentary","noteId":"tertullian-against-marcion-v-iv-2239"},{"text":"[^tertullian-against-marcion-v-iv-2240]: Luke xi. 8 .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"tertullian-against-marcion-v-iv-2240"},{"text":"[^tertullian-against-marcion-v-iv-2241]: Tam cito.","kind":"commentary","noteId":"tertullian-against-marcion-v-iv-2241"},{"text":"[^tertullian-against-marcion-v-iv-2242]: Luke xi. 11–13 .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"tertullian-against-marcion-v-iv-2242"},{"text":"[^tertullian-against-marcion-v-iv-2243]: Apud quem.","kind":"commentary","noteId":"tertullian-against-marcion-v-iv-2243"},{"text":"[^tertullian-against-marcion-v-iv-2244]: Luke xi. 14 .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"tertullian-against-marcion-v-iv-2244"},{"text":"[^tertullian-against-marcion-v-iv-2245]: Isa. xxix. 18 .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"tertullian-against-marcion-v-iv-2245"},{"text":"[^tertullian-against-marcion-v-iv-2246]: Luke xi. 19 .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"tertullian-against-marcion-v-iv-2246"},{"text":"[^tertullian-against-marcion-v-iv-2247]: Luke xi. 18 .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"tertullian-against-marcion-v-iv-2247"},{"text":"[^tertullian-against-marcion-v-iv-2248]: Luke xi. 20 .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"tertullian-against-marcion-v-iv-2248"},{"text":"[^tertullian-against-marcion-v-iv-2249]: Ex. viii. 19 .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"tertullian-against-marcion-v-iv-2249"},{"text":"[^tertullian-against-marcion-v-iv-2250]: Significaret.","kind":"commentary","noteId":"tertullian-against-marcion-v-iv-2250"},{"text":"[^tertullian-against-marcion-v-iv-2251]: Vetustatum scilicet suarum.","kind":"commentary","noteId":"tertullian-against-marcion-v-iv-2251"},{"text":"[^tertullian-against-marcion-v-iv-2252]: Apud.","kind":"commentary","noteId":"tertullian-against-marcion-v-iv-2252"},{"text":"[^tertullian-against-marcion-v-iv-2253]: Applicuit.","kind":"commentary","noteId":"tertullian-against-marcion-v-iv-2253"},{"text":"[^tertullian-ag